# Optional. Leave unset: the app calls the API on the same site at /api/v1 (on Vercel the
# root vercel.json routes /api/* to the FastAPI service; locally `npm run dev` proxies /api to
# http://localhost:8000). Set this only to point a local frontend at a different API, e.g.
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://nammu-ai.vercel.app/api/v1
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
